# Docker build context for apps/api/Dockerfile (M4.7). Keep secrets and local data OUT of images.

# Secrets and local-only data (never in a build context or image)
.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/dev-identities.json
**/integrity-archive/
**/checkpoint-archive*.json
**/backups/
.claude/

# Dependencies, build output and caches (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/blob-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log

# Not needed to build the API (the web manifest stays: it is a lockfile importer)
.git
.github
docs
apps/web/**
!apps/web/package.json
apps/admin
apps/mobile
